# Copy to .env.local and fill in from your Supabase project:
#   Project Settings -> Data API -> Project URL and anon/public key.
#
# The anon key is meant to be public — it identifies the project, not the
# caller. Row level security decides what it can reach, and the schema grants
# the anonymous role read access to nothing. Do not put the service_role key
# here: that one bypasses RLS entirely and must never reach a browser.
#
# With these unset the app runs on the bundled sample trip, so a fresh clone
# works with no setup at all.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
